<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.60 vs    0.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.67 vs    1.99</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 13.23 vs    8.03</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	22.10 vs   16.40</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.80 vs    7.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   22.10 vs   15.50</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 90.37 vs   58.17</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     152.41 vs  109.33</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
